    <div class="warning-box">
        <h4><i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i> Banners Can Lie</h4>
        <p>Some administrators deliberately change or hide banners to make fingerprinting harder. Manual banner grabbing is a great starting point, but it should never be the only method relied upon.</p>
