    <h2>Scaling Beyond Manual Checks</h2>

    <p>Reading banners manually works, but it does not scale to hundreds of ports across many hosts. Automated tools solve this by sending a series of carefully crafted probes to each open port and comparing the responses against a large signature database.</p>

    <p>This process resembles a doctor running a specific set of diagnostic tests rather than just asking a patient to describe how they feel. Each probe is designed to draw out a distinctive response, and the combination of responses is matched against known signatures to produce a confident identification.</p>

