            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="success-box">
        <h4><i class="fas fa-lightbulb"></i> Key Point</h4>
        <p>The version number, not just the service name, is what ultimately determines whether something needs urgent attention.</p>
    </div>
</div>
